  "comment": "Recipe will trigger on a schedule. The way this recipe runs is it will remind for the timesheets of the full prior week. So leaving this set to 2pm on Monday will remind Users who have not submitted Timesheets for the week of the previous Monday to Sunday. You can change this to be any day of the week and it will look at the previous week's Timesheet.",
